{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u203bThe demo version currently supports only Simplified and Traditional Chinese, while the full release will include English and other languages.</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Revive the Escort Guild's Legacy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a renowned escort guild, it fell into ruin after a bloody massacre. As its new leader, you must rebuild from the ashes. Construct Training Hall, Kitchen, Forge, and Pill Refinery to restore your guild's glory and expand its reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/41df30e7ed6985e943bd58d20dc9c14a.poster.avif?t=1767076422\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/41df30e7ed6985e943bd58d20dc9c14a.webm?t=1767076422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/41df30e7ed6985e943bd58d20dc9c14a.mp4?t=1767076422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While growing your guild's renown far and wide, you'll edge into the empire's power struggles. Amid clashes of the Jianghu, Court, and Pirates, piece together the dark secrets of the massacre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/45fdd542f011810999745bb9d7dc40df.poster.avif?t=1767076422\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/45fdd542f011810999745bb9d7dc40df.webm?t=1767076422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/45fdd542f011810999745bb9d7dc40df.mp4?t=1767076422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Social Savvy, Silver Tongue</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escort tradition speaks of &quot;Three Harmonies&quot;\u2014smile, spirits, and savvy. In the Jianghu, diplomacy matters as much as steel. A silver tongue or iron liver? Sometimes the best weapons never draw blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/01e168e80f4710a0a25e4441b0c6fc24.poster.avif?t=1767076422\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/01e168e80f4710a0a25e4441b0c6fc24.webm?t=1767076422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/01e168e80f4710a0a25e4441b0c6fc24.mp4?t=1767076422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blades and Shadows, Hidden Arts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Jianghu life is filled with drawn steel and flying fists. Forge bonds with righteous heroes and recruit 15+ unique escorts, each with their own skills, traits, and martial arts to develop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover 40+ martial arts styles and freely mix them with your escorts' skills. Outsmart bandits in thrilling auto-battles that blend speed with strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/0962d6ac3dc52ab36cb17459a8349eef.poster.avif?t=1767076422\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/0962d6ac3dc52ab36cb17459a8349eef.webm?t=1767076422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/0962d6ac3dc52ab36cb17459a8349eef.mp4?t=1767076422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Living Jianghu, Shaped by All</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taste classic snacks like savory tofu pudding, street pancakes, and even ancient-style milk tea in a lovingly crafted pixel Jianghu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/049976dc4a907adf9cfed0855aa90c8c.poster.avif?t=1767076422\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/049976dc4a907adf9cfed0855aa90c8c.webm?t=1767076422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/049976dc4a907adf9cfed0855aa90c8c.mp4?t=1767076422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true Jianghu is woven by its people. Players from far and wide have shared their brilliant ideas: new adventures, interesting martial arts, and tempting secret recipes. From the bottom of our hearts, thank you for your unwavering support. Glad to hear your thoughts on our community channels, and we can't wait to welcome you all to Three Harmonies soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/3b136b7f8bbab923419bf8311f902446.poster.avif?t=1767076422\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/3b136b7f8bbab923419bf8311f902446.webm?t=1767076422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/3b136b7f8bbab923419bf8311f902446.mp4?t=1767076422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3745920?t=1767076422","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3745920?t=1767076422","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/e6fed8cfdae28ada9607741d58e7f165872d97cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767076422","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/e6fed8cfdae28ada9607741d58e7f165872d97cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767076422","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3750330,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u203bThe demo version currently supports only Simplified and Traditional Chinese, while the full release will include English and other languages.</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Revive the Escort Guild's Legacy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a renowned escort guild, it fell into ruin after a bloody massacre. As its new leader, you must rebuild from the ashes. Construct Training Hall, Kitchen, Forge, and Pill Refinery to restore your guild's glory and expand its reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/41df30e7ed6985e943bd58d20dc9c14a.poster.avif?t=1767076422\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/41df30e7ed6985e943bd58d20dc9c14a.webm?t=1767076422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src