t=1767076422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blades and Shadows, Hidden Arts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Jianghu life is filled with drawn steel and flying fists. Forge bonds with righteous heroes and recruit 15+ unique escorts, each with their own skills, traits, and martial arts to develop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover 40+ martial arts styles and freely mix them with your escorts' skills. Outsmart bandits in thrilling auto-battles that blend speed with strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/0962d6ac3dc52ab36cb17459a8349eef.poster.avif?t=1767076422\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/0962d6ac3dc52ab36cb17459a8349eef.webm?t=1767076422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/0962d6ac3dc52ab36cb17459a8349eef.mp4?t=1767076422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Living Jianghu, Shaped by All</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taste classic snacks like savory tofu pudding, street pancakes, and even ancient-style milk tea in a lovingly crafted pixel Jianghu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/049976dc4a907adf9cfed0855aa90c8c.poster.avif?t=1767076422\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/049976dc4a907adf9cfed0855aa90c8c.webm?t=1767076422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/049976dc4a907adf9cfed0855aa90c8c.mp4?t=1767076422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true Jianghu is woven by its people. Players from far and wide have shared their brilliant ideas: new adventures, interesting martial arts, and tempting secret recipes. From the bottom of our hearts, thank you for your unwavering support. Glad to hear your thoughts on our community channels, and we can't wait to welcome you all to Three Harmonies soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/3b136b7f8bbab923419bf8311f902446.poster.avif?t=1767076422\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/3b136b7f8bbab923419bf8311f902446.webm?t=1767076422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/3b136b7f8bbab923419bf8311f902446.mp4?t=1767076422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["\u65e0\u91cf\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/703e516266570741ba1a54bd2d5d8125e97adabc/header.jpg?t=1767076422","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3745920/955783642/cc7c